OL,3,GNEWSAStudent stabbed housemate 30 times
OL,4,Ain masked ambush
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter returning home, Coughlan cooked a
OL,7,Fpizza, played online games with friends
OL,8,Fand then called police. The jury heard
OL,9,Fthat Coughlan accepts he killed Collins
OL,10,Fbut denies murder.
